  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Environmental Management and Climate Resilience Project (IEMCRP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Programme aims to support The Gambia on strategic programmatic interventions in Climate Resilience (mitigation and adaptation), Disaster Risk Management, Renewable Energy Access, Natural Resource Management and Sustainable Chemicals and Waste Management. This will contribute to the attainment of Sustainable Development Goals 7, 13, 15 and 17. The Programme will also reduce the vulnerability of communities and natural systems to climate change through sustainable natural resource and Disaster</narrative>
  </description>
